  "notes": "USAGE:\nA somewhat literary word that implies deep, prolonged thinking. Often appears in set phrases.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {思案|しあん}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{暮|く}れる (to be lost in thought)\n- {思案|しあん}⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{末|すえ}→末：03362_sue⟧ (after much deliberation)\n- {思案|しあん}{投|な}げ{首|くび} (racking one's brains; lit. \"thought-throwing neck\")\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{熟考|じゅっこう}→熟考：07966_jukkou⟧: careful consideration — more formal, emphasizes thoroughness\n- ⟦{検討|けんとう}→検討：02710_kentou⟧: examination, review — more practical and systematic, common in business",
